---
import Docs from "../layouts/Docs.astro";
import { colorNames, colors, motion, radius, typeScale, zIndex } from "../../../src/tokens.generated";
---

<Docs title="Theming and tokens">
  <article class="flex max-w-4xl flex-col gap-10">
    <header class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl">Theming and tokens</h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-fg-muted">
        Every value below is read from <code>tokens/tokens.ts</code> at build time. Colours are OKLCH. ikada is dark
        unless <code>data-theme="light"</code> is set on <code>&lt;html&gt;</code>; the shadcn theme maps light to
        <code>:root</code> and dark to <code>.dark</code>. Use the switch in the header to compare.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="flex flex-col gap-3" aria-labelledby="colours">
      <h2 id="colours" class="text-lg">Colours</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-surface shadow-card">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[34rem] text-left text-sm">
          <thead class="text-fg-muted">
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Token</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Light</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Dark</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {colorNames.map((n) => (
              <tr class="border-b border-hairline last:border-0">
                <td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono whitespace-nowrap">--sb-{n}</td>
                {[colors.light[n], colors.dark[n]].map((v) => (
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs whitespace-nowrap">
                      <span class="size-5 shrink-0 rounded-sm shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_oklch(0.5_0_0/0.3)]" style={`background:${v}`} />
                      {v}
                    </span>
                  </td>
                ))}
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="flex flex-col gap-3" aria-labelledby="type">
      <h2 id="type" class="text-lg">Type scale</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl bg-surface p-4 shadow-card">
        {Object.entries(typeScale).map(([name, s]) => (
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
            <span class="w-16 shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-muted">{name}</span>
            <span class="truncate" style={`font-size:${s.size / 16}rem;line-height:${s.line / 16}rem;font-weight:${s.weight};letter-spacing:${s.tracking}em`}>Deploy my-app to production</span>
            <span class="ms-auto shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-muted">{s.size}/{s.line}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="flex flex-col gap-3" aria-labelledby="radius">
      <h2 id="radius" class="text-lg">Radius</h2>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4">
        {Object.entries(radius).map(([name, r]) => (
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl bg-surface p-3 shadow-card">
            <span class="h-12 bg-hover" style={`border-radius:${name === "full" ? "9999px" : `${r.px}px`}`} />
            <span class="font-mono text-xs">{name} · {name === "full" ? "full" : `${r.px}px`}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="flex flex-col gap-3" aria-labelledby="motion">
      <h2 id="motion" class="text-lg">Motion: Afloat</h2>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-fg-muted">
        The raft takes your weight: a press settles 1px down and 3% smaller in {motion.duration.press}ms, and the
        release returns on <code>bob</code>, which overshoots once. Nothing else bounces. Each spring is a duration and
        a bounce, sampled to a CSS <code>linear()</code> curve in <code>theme.css</code>. Under reduced motion every
        spring becomes a {motion.reducedSpring.duration}ms ease-out and only fades stay.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl bg-surface p-4 shadow-card">
        {Object.entries(motion.spring).map(([name, s]) => (
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
            <span class="w-40 shrink-0 font-mono text-xs">--sb-spring-{name}</span>
            <span class="w-32 shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-muted">{s.seconds}s, bounce {s.bounce}</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-fg-muted">{s.use}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="flex flex-col gap-3" aria-labelledby="layers">
      <h2 id="layers" class="text-lg">Layers</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {Object.entries(zIndex).map(([name, z]) => (
          <li class="rounded-md bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs shadow-card">--sb-z-{name}: {z}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</Docs>
